  "body": "## What changed\n- Route `v_post` (`cam.post` and the MCP `post` tool) in `crates/app/src/script/api.rs` to `posting::post_per_op_with_script_options` and `posting::post_per_op_script_with_options` when `per_op` is `true`.\n- Resolve the target directory and base program name with `super::report::per_op_target` and build the result with `super::report::posted_per_op_view`.\n- Document `operations?: PostedOpInfo[]` on `PostResult` and add `interface PostedOpInfo` in `crates/app/src/script/mod.rs` and `assets/scripts/cam.d.ts`.\n- Add `posting_mounts::refuse_per_op` in `crates/app/src/posting_mounts.rs` and call it from `posting_mounts::single`, `posting_mounts::post_mounts_with`, and `posting::stream_records` when `per_op` is `true`.\n- Record the design decision in `docs/decisions/2188-per-op-post-setup-change.md`.\n\n## Cause\n- `posting_setup_change::stop_of` suppresses between-setups stops when `per_op` is `true` because each operation runs as a standalone file.\n- `v_post` previously called `post_mounts_with_script_options` or `post_mounts_script_with_options`, which wrote one combined program without setup-change stops.\n- Combined-program APIs (`post_setup`, `post_script`, `post_setup_unwritten`, `post_mounts`, `post_mounts_script`, and `stream_records`) also accepted `per_op: true` instead of refusing it.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins added and verified red before the fix, then green after the fix:\n  - `crates/app/tests/between_setups.rs`: `mcp_post_with_per_op_writes_standalone_files_and_never_drops_setup_stop`\n  - `crates/app/tests/between_setups.rs`: `combined_post_apis_refuse_when_per_op_is_enabled`\n  - `crates/app/tests/scripting.rs`: `cam_post_with_per_op_writes_standalone_files`\n- Mutation checks:\n  - Reverted `crates/app/src/script/api.rs` to `upstream/main`: `mcp_post_with_per_op_writes_standalone_files_and_never_drops_setup_stop` failed and `cam_post_with_per_op_writes_standalone_files` failed. Restored: both pass.\n  - Commented out `refuse_per_op` in `posting_mounts.rs::single`: `combined_post_apis_refuse_when_per_op_is_enabled` failed. Restored: passes.\n  - Commented out `refuse_per_op` in `posting_mounts.rs::post_mounts_with`: `combined_post_apis_refuse_when_per_op_is_enabled` failed. Restored: passes.\n  - Reverted `crates/app/src/posting.rs` (`stream_records` guard): `combined_post_apis_refuse_when_per_op_is_enabled` failed. Restored: passes.\n- Gate and lint checks after final edits:\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: `app lib` passed (`350 passed; 0 failed; 1 ignored`); `186` of `187` selected app suites passed (including `between_setups`, `per_op_files`, `scripting`, `setup_post_options`, `setup_mounts_post`, `mcp`, `posting`, and `cli`).\n  - Pre-existing failure in `gate quick`: `first_4axis_part::the_committed_project_posts_the_committed_program` failed with `\"Flat A-90: inputs moved since generation - regenerate before posting\"`. Open issue #2198 tracks this failure on `upstream/main`.\n  - `cargo xtask gate test post --crate camcraft-app --binary mcp_post_options`: passed (`5` tests).\n  - `cargo xtask gate batch --only clippy` (`--all-targets -- -D warnings` on workspace crates): passed (`0` warnings).\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- `cargo xtask gate full` did not run.\n- This headless session does not launch the desktop GUI interactively.\n\n## Overlaps\n- `crates/app/src/posting.rs`: #2149 (`verification_report_by`), #2140 (`posted_rpm`), #2136 (`options_value`, `post_script_body`, `op_streams_by`, `wcs_yaw`), and #1681 (`op_streams`). Touches the same file, different function (`stream_records`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `crates/app/src/script/api.rs`: #2101 (`v_import`). Touches the same file, different function (`v_post`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `crates/app/src/script/mod.rs` and `assets/scripts/cam.d.ts`: #2134 (`VERBS`, `DxfProfile`, `CamApi`) and #2101 (`step_source_tests`). Touches the same files, different items (`PostResult`, `PostedOpInfo`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: Route MCP post and cam.post to per-operation files when per_op is enabled, and refuse combined-program posting APIs.\nFixes #2188\n",
